        "**Protocol**\n",
        "1. **Chronological split, no shuffling** (Figure 6), so models are always evaluated on data that comes after their training data.\n",
        "2. **Tuning on validation only.** The test set is used once, at the end. (The sample code in the lab sheet used the test set as validation data, which would bias the reported test error.)\n",
